#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:1
msgid "Compute resources and the global sandbox location"
msgstr "计算资源与全局沙箱位置"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:3
msgid ""
"Use Admin → Servers to deploy existing SSH machines or CloudLab "
"allocations, manage their leases, and choose where new sandboxes run. "
"Operations and renewal run in the control plane, so closing the browser "
"does not stop them. The [compute lifecycle "
"design](../agents/specs/2026-10-04-compute-resource-lifecycle-design.zh-"
"CN.md) records the protocol; [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md"
"#optional-compute-resource-management) lists the configuration."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin → Servers 中部署已有的 SSH 机器或 CloudLab "
"分配，管理它们的租期，并选择新沙箱在哪里运行。操作和续期都在控制平面中运行，关掉浏览器也不会中断。[计算资源生命周期设计](../agents/specs/2026-10-04"
"-compute-resource-lifecycle-design.zh-"
"CN.md)记录了相关协议；[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#optional-compute-"
"resource-management) 列出了配置项。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:10
msgid ""
"The global sandbox location applies to **all new, still-unassigned "
"sandbox groups**. Retained groups, stopped ones and their Fork members "
"included, keep their Host. `Automatic` clears the restriction. A selected"
" Host that is unavailable keeps work waiting; nothing falls back to "
"another Host."
msgstr ""
"全局沙箱位置作用于**所有新建且尚未分配的沙箱组**。保留的组，包括已停止的组及其 Fork 成员，都留在原来的 Host "
"上。`Automatic` 取消这项限制。选中的 Host 不可用时，工作会一直等待，不会转到其他 Host。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:15
msgid "What stays on stable infrastructure"
msgstr "哪些组件留在稳定的基础设施上"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:17
msgid ""
"Keep the control plane, Postgres, background worker, deployment profiles,"
" provider credentials and the settings root key on stable infrastructure."
" A managed resource runs only the Host, sandbox manager, tunnels and "
"sandboxes. Provider expiry is a hard limit; renewal does not guarantee "
"uptime."
msgstr ""
"控制平面、Postgres、后台 worker、部署配置、服务商凭据和设置根密钥都要放在稳定的基础设施上。托管资源上只运行 "
"Host、sandbox manager、隧道和沙箱。服务商的到期时间是硬性限制，续期不保证一直可用。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:22
msgid ""
"Stored API tokens and management SSH keys are encrypted with the compute "
"credential key (`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY`), a setting stored in the "
"database under the settings root key. Keep the settings root key with "
"every database backup: without it, compute connections and every other "
"saved secret are lost. Do not reuse account, settings, enrollment or "
"sandbox manager keys. Compute management credentials never enter "
"sandboxes or the deployed Host."
msgstr ""
"已保存的 API 令牌和管理用 SSH "
"密钥用计算凭据密钥（`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY`）加密，这个密钥作为一项设置保存在数据库中，本身又用设置根密钥加密。每次备份数据库都要一并保存设置根密钥：没有它，计算连接和其他所有已保存的"
" secret 都无法恢复。不要复用账号、设置、注册或 sandbox manager 的密钥。计算管理凭据永远不会进入沙箱或部署出去的 "
"Host。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:29
msgid ""
"The Host needs its own tunnel credentials and "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`, which is pool-wide: every deployment "
"profile uses the control plane's value."
msgstr ""
"Host 需要自己的隧道凭据和 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`；后者在整个主机池共用，每个部署配置都使用控制平面的那个值。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:32
msgid "Supported initial deployment"
msgstr "支持的初始部署方式"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:34
msgid "Automatic SSH bootstrap supports:"
msgstr "自动 SSH 初始化支持以下环境："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:36
msgid "Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04 on x86-64;"
msgstr "x86-64 上的 Ubuntu 22.04 或 24.04；"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:37
msgid "Python 3, passwordless `sudo` and working KVM;"
msgstr "Python 3、免密码 `sudo` 和可用的 KVM；"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:38
msgid ""
"reachable package repositories and the pinned Kata release, when it "
"installs prerequisites."
msgstr "安装前置依赖时，能访问软件包仓库和固定版本的 Kata 发布包。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:41
msgid ""
"With `install_prerequisites=true`, bootstrap installs `docker.io`, "
"`docker-compose-v2`, `curl`, `ca-certificates`, `xz-utils` and "
"`nftables`, starts Docker and runs the repository's checksum-pinned Kata "
"installer. With it false, Docker, Compose and the approved Kata runtime "
"must already exist. Kata is required either way."
msgstr ""
"设置 `install_prerequisites=true` 时，bootstrap 会安装 `docker.io`、`docker-"
"compose-v2`、`curl`、`ca-certificates`、`xz-utils` 和 `nftables`，启动 "
"Docker，并运行仓库中带校验和固定的 Kata 安装程序。设为 false 时，Docker、Compose 和批准的 Kata "
"运行时必须已经存在。无论哪种方式，都必须有 Kata。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:47
msgid ""
"The node needs no Cloud Agent preinstalled. Bootstrap uploads a reviewed "
"source bundle and configuration, then runs `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh "
"up` and `check`, which verify Kata, the guest observer, sandbox manager, "
"relays and nftables. The Host takes no work until those checks, an "
"enrolled heartbeat and a control-plane-to-sandbox-manager health check "
"pass. Automatic deployment handles one node per allocation and refuses "
"multi-node CloudLab experiments, which can still be observed. A failed "
"installation leaves the resource visible and intact."
msgstr ""
"节点不需要预装 Cloud Agent。bootstrap 会上传经过审查的源码包和配置，然后运行 "
"`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh up` 和 `check`，检查 Kata、客户机观察程序、sandbox "
"manager、中继和 nftables。只有这些检查、一次已注册的心跳以及控制平面到 sandbox manager "
"的健康检查都通过后，Host 才开始接收工作。自动部署每个分配只处理一个节点，会拒绝多节点的 CloudLab "
"实验（但仍可以观察它们）。安装失败时资源保持可见，不会被销毁。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:55
msgid "Preferred CloudLab node types"
msgstr "优先选用的 CloudLab 节点类型"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:57
msgid ""
"New CloudLab allocations try these types in order. They are general-"
"purpose families from 2021 or later with at least 16 physical cores, 128 "
"GiB RAM and more than 20 nodes, checked against the [CloudLab hardware "
"catalog](https://docs.cloudlab.us/hardware.html) and [public "
"inventory](https://www.cloudlab.us/portal-hardware.php) on October 12, "
"2026."
msgstr ""
"新的 CloudLab 分配会按顺序尝试下列类型。它们都是 2021 年及以后推出的通用机型，至少有 16 个物理核心、128 GiB "
"内存，总节点数超过 20 台，于 2026 年 10 月 12 日对照 [CloudLab "
"硬件目录](https://docs.cloudlab.us/hardware.html)和[公开库存](https://www.cloudlab.us"
"/portal-hardware.php)核实。"

